### Locale Setup

To activate locale switching, create a middleware and register it.

**1. Create `app/Http/Middleware/SetLocale.php`:**

```php
<?php

namespace App\Http\Middleware;

use Closure;
use Illuminate\Http\Request;

class SetLocale
{
    protected array $supported = ['en', 'fr', 'es'];

    public function handle(Request $request, Closure $next)
    {
        // Pick one strategy:
        // $locale = $request->segment(1);                              // URL segment
        // $locale = session('locale', $request->cookie('locale'));      // Session/cookie
        // $locale = $request->getPreferredLanguage($this->supported);  // Accept-Language header

        if (isset($locale) && in_array($locale, $this->supported)) {
            app()->setLocale($locale);
        }

        return $next($request);
    }
}
```

**2. Register in `bootstrap/app.php`:**

```php
->withMiddleware(function (Middleware $middleware) {
    $middleware->web(append: [
        \App\Http\Middleware\SetLocale::class,
    ]);
})
```

